/**
 * The pattern library.
 *
 * Every entry carries a real position drawn with the coordinate helper, so the
 * picture on the card is generated by the same renderer used in play. The
 * definitions are deliberately short and accurate; the deeper explanation lives
 * in the linked lesson.
 */

